      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-287598",
      ":question/problem": "Tickets were sold for a play, generating $$250$ in revenue. Adult tickets cost $$20$ and student tickets cost $$10$. The equation $20a + 10s = 250$ models this situation, where $a$ is the number of adult tickets and $s$ is the number of student tickets. If $5$ adult tickets were sold, how many student tickets were sold?"
